      "cooked": "<p>The Body Swap story</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-182-writers-room-justice-comics-299\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2195fb0b2700b1df502aa120a68af896730a6609.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-182-writers-room-justice-comics-299\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #182 - Writers’ Room: Justice Comics #299</a></h3>\n\n<p>Time for a quick switcheroo!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:25:22 Let's swap some bodies! Just who will get swapped, and to what end? The cover above gives at least a little of it away, but not enough to ruin the story... not by a long shot!  After...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e293b703c223ddf394ee44320438279a745c11a6.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/e293b703c223ddf394ee44320438279a745c11a6\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e293b703c223ddf394ee44320438279a745c11a6_2_353x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"wkonVVxWhdzYD5hBdWjmIHSUywu\" width=\"353\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e293b703c223ddf394ee44320438279a745c11a6_2_353x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e293b703c223ddf394ee44320438279a745c11a6_2_529x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e293b703c223ddf394ee44320438279a745c11a6_2_706x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e293b703c223ddf394ee44320438279a745c11a6_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1447×2046 2.35 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
