      "username": "The_Justifier",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-07-14T02:58:55.869Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It’s a mountain-sized eyesore from where I’m looking at it.  If it looks like a molehill to you, then your aesthetics are different than mine, which is fine of course; we all have different opinions, and my opinion is that this otherwise-very-fitting Silver Age-style cover features a costume design for Tachyon that I really, really hate.  It’s as far away from representing “my” Tachyon as the Adam West TV show costume is from representing “my” {CENSORED}.</p>",
