      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "It's a mountain-sized eyesore from where I'm looking at it.  If it looks like a molehill to you, then your aesthetics are different than mine, which is fine of course; we all have different opinions, and my opinion is that this otherwise-very-fitting Silver Age-style cover features a costume design for Tachyon that I really, really hate.  It's as far away from representing \"my\" Tachyon as the Adam West TV show costume is from representing \"my\" {CENSORED}.",
