      "username": "Jeysie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-07-14T14:35:07.118Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes. I double-checked my memory, and the type of running shoes Tachyon usually wears didn’t exist/start being popular enough to show up in entertainment until the 1960s. Before that athletic shoes were more plain-looking canvas shoes. So she gets the Standard Comic Book Boot that many other Sentinels characters have.</p>\n<p>(Although my memory was a bit off, I thought it was the 1970s, it was actually earlier. But still later than would have shown up on this cover.)</p>\n<p>If you really want a drastic costume change, might I present something like <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/sh/6c2ml3orprolis5/AADnGL2T2-su-AksOfUsr1uAa/Argent%20Adept?dl=0&amp;preview=1st+Appearance+Argent+Adept+Front.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">old skool Argent Adept</a>.</p>",
      "post_number": 10,
      "post_type": 1,
