      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Yes. I double-checked my memory, and the type of running shoes Tachyon usually wears didn't exist/start being popular enough to show up in entertainment until the 1960s. Before that athletic shoes were more plain-looking canvas shoes. So she gets the Standard Comic Book Boot that many other Sentinels characters have.\n\n(Although my memory was a bit off, I thought it was the 1970s, it was actually earlier. But still later than would have shown up on this cover.)\n\nIf you really want a drastic costume change, might I present something like [old skool Argent Adept](https://www.dropbox.com/sh/6c2ml3orprolis5/AADnGL2T2-su-AksOfUsr1uAa/Argent%20Adept?dl=0&preview=1st+Appearance+Argent+Adept+Front.png).",
